{"2932680": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Nomori", "steam_appid": 2932680, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHANGE YOUR REALITY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge your understanding of the world’s physical limits. Place, shift, and rotate portals to change the gravity direction of objects and even yourself. Make clever use of portals to reach new places, and make every surface a floor! Use your Spirit Powers to further influence the world around you. Control the flow of time and rotate the forces of gravity to solve mind-bending environmental puzzles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932680/extras/a1c390f919fafc0e69a8bc6427257654.poster.avif?t=1787134224\" width=960 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932680/extras/a1c390f919fafc0e69a8bc6427257654.webm?t=1787134224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932680/extras/a1c390f919fafc0e69a8bc6427257654.mp4?t=1787134224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A COLORFUL SPIRIT WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Kiko, a curious girl stuck in a whimsical spirit world in trouble. Meet a colorful cast of characters that will challenge Kiko to see the world, and herself, from exciting new perspectives. As Kiko comes into her own and bonds with the Spirits, she will see beyond the limits of reality and find the means to save Nomori. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932680/extras/8d63b5911b42b05b9a7846eaa4ddc4af.poster.avif?t=1787134224\" width=960 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932680/extras/8d63b5911b42b05b9a7846eaa4ddc4af.webm?t=1787134224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932680/extras/8d63b5911b42b05b9a7846eaa4ddc4af.mp4?t=1787134224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THINK OUTSIDE THE BOX</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore every corner of your surroundings—the more you seek, the more you’ll find. Combine your Spirit Powers to create new outcomes; play with gravity and timing in a physics-based world to reach new heights! There are lots of ways to solve puzzles and to look at the world around you. Don’t be afraid to get creative—perspective is everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932680/extras/8d66c97a468089c45d40154f1f19bb05.poster.avif?t=1787134224\" width=960 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932680/extras/8d66c97a468089c45d40154f1f19bb05.webm?t=1787134224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932680/extras/8d66c97a468089c45d40154f1f19bb05.mp4?t=1787134224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SHIFTING SEASONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through all the seasons of Nomori! Explore four unique domains, each with its own environment, puzzle mechanics and cast of Spirits. Use Kiko’s Spirit Powers to master every season, and to bridge the shattered islands of the Spirit World together. Backtrack through levels with new Spirit Powers to see and navigate them through a brand new lens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932680/extras/c9b3722ab942332a572829ec5de50d17.poster.avif?t=1787134224\" width=960 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932680/extras/c9b3722ab942332a572829ec5de50d17.webm?t=1787134224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932680/extras/c9b3722ab942332a572829ec5de50d17.mp4?t=1787134224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHANGE YOUR REALITY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge your understanding of the world’s physical limits. Place, shift, and rotate portals to change the gravity direction of objects and even yourself. Make clever use of portals to reach new places, and make every surface a floor! Use your Spirit Powers to further influence the world around you. Control the flow of time and rotate the forces of gravity to solve mind-bending environmental puzzles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932680/extras/a1c390f919fafc0e69a8bc6427257654.poster.avif?t=1787134224\" width=960 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932680/extras/a1c390f919fafc0e69a8bc6427257654.webm?t=1787134224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932680/extras/a1c390f919fafc0e69a8bc6427257654.mp4?t=1787134224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A COLORFUL SPIRIT WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Kiko, a curious girl stuck in a whimsical spirit world in trouble. Meet a colorful cast of characters that will challenge Kiko to see the world, and herself, from exciting new perspectives. As Kiko comes into her own and bonds with the Spirits, she will see beyond the limits of reality and find the means to save Nomori. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932680/extras/8d63b5911b42b05b9a7846eaa4ddc4af.poster.avif?t=1787134224\" width=960 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932680/extras/8d63b5911b42b05b9a7846eaa4ddc4af.webm?t=1787134224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932680/extras/8d63b5911b42b05b9a7846eaa4ddc4af.mp4?t=1787134224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THINK OUTSIDE THE BOX</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore every corner of your surroundings—the more you seek, the more you’ll find. Combine your Spirit Powers to create new outcomes; play with gravity and timing in a physics-based world to reach new heights! There are lots of ways to solve puzzles and to look at the world around you. Don’t be afraid to get creative—perspective is everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932680/extras/8d66c97a468089c45d40154f1f19bb05.poster.avif?t=1787134224\" width=960 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932680/extras/8d66c97a468089c45d40154f1f19bb05.webm?t=1787134224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932680/extras/8d66c97a468089c45d40154f1f19bb05.mp4?t=1787134224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SHIFTING SEASONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through all the seasons of Nomori! Explore four unique domains, each with its own environment, puzzle mechanics and cast of Spirits. Use Kiko’s Spirit Powers to master every season, and to bridge the shattered islands of the Spirit World together. Backtrack through levels with new Spirit Powers to see and navigate them through a brand new lens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932680/extras/c9b3722ab942332a572829ec5de50d17.poster.avif?t=1787134224\" width=960 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932680/extras/c9b3722ab942332a572829ec5de50d17.webm?t=1787134224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932680/extras/c9b3722ab942332a572829ec5de50d17.mp4?t=1787134224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Nomori is a mind-bending adventure game where you control time and space to journey through a whimsical spirit world. Take shortcuts through portals, rotate your perspective, and control the flow of time to solve puzzles that are out of this world.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932680/6b2068bba1a425bba555ce9a4a6235e65f08a380/header.jpg?t=1787134224", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932680/e059dce1b77341f6e1214fbf38dfc571c676f280/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787134224", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932680/e059dce1b77341f6e1214fbf38dfc571c676f280/capsu